A '''hyperlane''' began at [[Gerrenthum]] and continued to [[Council (planet)|Council]], [[Nothoiin]], the [[Saila Na system]], and [[Bavva]],<ref name="BMF" /> before stretching westward to [[Eriadu]] on the [[Hydian Way]].<ref name="Map" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, the route was known as the [[Nothoiin Corridor]]. The route was included on a map of the [[Anoat sector]] in the "[[Guide to the Galaxy]]" section of [[Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon 18|''Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon'' 18]], but the label for the route was cut off.

